d{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+2 & 2+4 & 5+10 \\\\ -4+6 & 3+8 & 2+12\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 & 15 \\\\ 2 & 11 & 14\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186547198 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6727fdd-a614-5ead-9273-08c0a7fec997" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Linear Combination of Two Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27e859be-ef87-5c8b-b82f-3e14de091e23" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}10 & 12 \\\\ 16 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547211} {:answer/id #uuid "51521ee9-aa4d-54a0-b386-1e47d1cdc18a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547225} {:answer/id #uuid "cded47bb-9950-522e-8107-91402b0f5095" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547257} {:answer/id #uuid "e9e55f98-0c3d-5134-a53b-07a01ea0ab5a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 10 \\\\ 12 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547266} {:answer/id #uuid "f7a05140-3fc3-5ddb-8d93-a5583f52d3b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 8 \\\\ 12 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547271}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "27e859be-ef87-5c8b-b82f-3e14de091e23" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}10 & 12 \\\\ 16 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547211} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f8ec543-0c95-5a86-8b55-51b012ffeeb8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547242}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0aa607f4-650a-5e64-8dc8-4a90839dd876" :question/problem "Calculate $2F+2B$, where\n$F=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $F$ by $2$ and each entry of $B$ by $2,$ and then add the resulting matrices, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2F+2B & =2\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 2 & 2\\cdot 4 \\\\ 2\\cdot 4 & 2\\cdot 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 3 & 2\\cdot 2 \\\\ 2\\cdot 4 & 2\\cdot 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 8 \\\\ 8 & 8\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+6 & 8+4 \\\\ 8+8 & 8+2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}10 & 12 \\\\ 16 & 10\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186547205 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6727fdd-a614-5ead-9273-08c0a7fec997" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Linear Combination of Two Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "10efc1a3-cf97-5d3b-94e9-8b3245e4edba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}15 & 12 \\\\ 31 & 13\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547200} {:answer/id #uuid "18c48868-d901-5db6-b2c8-029b6ca8f044" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547203} {:answer/id #uuid "1e9fbb7d-fc70-535d-b733-167a89f4b774" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}24 & 12 \\\\ 28 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547206} {:answer/id #uuid "92fd41df-5ad6-5dae-90a4-14de6a3baf88" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547239} {:answer/id #uuid "9f420166-ec0b-5fd4-9d9e-43415d9d2819" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}21 & 12 \\\\ 29 & 11\\en