re\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $A$ by $3$ and each entry of $B$ by $2,$ and then add the resulting matrices, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3A+2B & =3\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3\\cdot 3 & 3\\cdot 3 \\\\ 3\\cdot 4 & 3\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 0 & 2\\cdot 3 \\\\ 2\\cdot 2 & 2\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 9 \\\\ 12 & 9\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}9+0 & 9+6 \\\\ 12+4 & 9+4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 15 \\\\ 16 & 13\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186547216 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6727fdd-a614-5ead-9273-08c0a7fec997" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Linear Combination of Two Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "db60baf4-1b59-55ef-a8fb-c9c833a2a2eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547260}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "db60baf4-1b59-55ef-a8fb-c9c833a2a2eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547260} :answer-field/id #uuid "058f07c8-5f73-5a3c-aeae-eb374917bfeb" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547196} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2452da6f-cdc9-5872-a3d3-7412163e8aec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547209}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2452da6f-cdc9-5872-a3d3-7412163e8aec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547209} :answer-field/id #uuid "412100a7-eb52-50c4-8414-e33946395a31" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-